      "to": "die",
      "group": "memory",
      "particles": 2
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "1. Weights sit in HBM3e (141 GB, 4.8 TB/s).",
      "focus": ["hbm-dram-left", "hbm-dram-right", "hbm-base-left", "hbm-base-right"],
      "dot": "hbm-dram-left",
      "explode": 0.6,
      "drill": null,
      "stage": "hbm"
    },
    {
      "text": "2. Memory controllers read the HBM stacks.",
      "focus": ["mc-left"],
      "dot": "mc-left",
      "stage": "memory-controller"
    },
    {
      "text": "3. Data lands in the 50 MB L2 cache.",
      "focus": ["l2"],
      "dot": "l2",
      "stage": "l2"
    },
    {
      "text": "4. TMA copies A and B tiles into shared memory, asynchronously.",
      "focus": ["tma"],
      "dot": "tma",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "tma"
    },
    {
      "text": "5. Tiles sit in shared memory, ready for the Tensor Cores.",
      "focus": ["smem"],
      "dot": "smem",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "shared-memory"
    },
    {
      "text": "6. A warpgroup issues wgmma: Tensor Cores multiply the tiles (e.g. in FP8).",
      "focus": ["tensor-core"],
      "dot": "tensor-core",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "tensor-core"
    },
    {
      "text": "7. Partial sums accumulate in registers — Hopper has no Tensor Memory.",
      "focus": ["register-file"],
      "dot": "register-file",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "accumulate"
    },
    {
      "text": "8. Epilogue: CUDA cores add bias, apply activation, quantize.",
      "focus": ["warp-scheduler", "register-file"],
      "dot": "warp-scheduler",
      "drill": "sm-detail",
      "stage": "epilogue"
    },
    {
      "text": "9. Results go back to HBM; with tensor parallelism, NVLink all-reduces with other GPUs.",
      "focus": ["nvlink"],
      "dot": "nvlink",
      "drill": null,
      "stage": "writeback"
    }
  ],
